{
  "info": {
    "name": "Eventual — Microservices Architecture",
    "description": "REST API collection for the Eventual Microservices architecture running on port 8080.\n\nGETTING STARTED\n1. Create 5 databases:\n    psql -U postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE eventual_users;'\n    psql -U postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE eventual_events;'\n    psql -U postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE eventual_notifications;'\n    psql -U postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE eventual_vendors;'\n    psql -U postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE eventual_support;'\n2. Load schemas:\n    psql -U postgres -d eventual_users         -f selected/eventual.database/user-service.sql\n    psql -U postgres -d eventual_events        -f selected/eventual.database/event-service.sql\n    psql -U postgres -d eventual_notifications -f selected/eventual.database/notification-service.sql\n    psql -U postgres -d eventual_vendors       -f selected/eventual.database/vendor-service.sql\n    psql -U postgres -d eventual_support       -f selected/eventual.database/support-service.sql\n3. Run the app: cd selected && docker compose up --build\n4. Register via POST /api/users/register\n5. Login via POST /api/users/login — the token is saved automatically to the collection variable\n\nROLES\n- ORGANIZER   — can create/update events, groups, vendors\n- PARTICIPANT  — can RSVP, join groups, post reviews\n- ADMIN        — cannot register via API; promote in DB:\n    UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@example.com';\n\nAUTH\nCollection-level Bearer auth reads {{token}}. The Login request auto-saves the token on success.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",           "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",              "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "organizer_email",    "value": "alice@example.com",     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "participant_email",  "value": "bob@example.com",       "type": "string" },
    { "key": "event_id",           "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "group_id",           "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vendor_id",          "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ticket_id",          "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id",    "value": "1",                     "type": "string" },
    { "key": "join_request_id",    "value": "1",                     "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth & Users",
      "description": "Registration, login, and profile management.\n/register and /login are public — all other endpoints require Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Organizer",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "email",        "value": "alice@example.com",                   "type": "text" },
                { "key": "name",         "value": "Alice Johnson",                       "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password",     "value": "Password123!",                        "type": "text" },
                { "key": "role",         "value": "ORGANIZER",                           "type": "text" },
                { "key": "pronoun",      "value": "she/her",                             "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location",     "value": "Dallas, TX",                          "type": "text" },
                { "key": "aboutMe",      "value": "Event organizer and tech enthusiast", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes","value": "Technology",                          "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes","value": "Music",                               "type": "text" },
                { "key": "profilePicture","value": "",                                   "type": "file", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Register as ORGANIZER. Valid roles: ORGANIZER, PARTICIPANT"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Participant",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "email",        "value": "bob@example.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "name",         "value": "Bob Smith",        "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password",     "value": "Password123!",     "type": "text" },
                { "key": "role",         "value": "PARTICIPANT",      "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location",     "value": "Dallas, TX",       "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes","value": "Sports",           "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes","value": "Gaming",           "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Register as PARTICIPANT — can RSVP, join groups, post vendor reviews."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Admin (then promote in DB)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "email",    "value": "admin@example.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "name",     "value": "Super Admin",        "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "Admin123!",          "type": "text" },
                { "key": "role",     "value": "ORGANIZER",          "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "ADMIN is not a registerable role. Register as ORGANIZER first, then promote in PostgreSQL:\n  UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@example.com';\nThen login again to get a fresh JWT with ADMIN role."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Returns { token, email, role }.\nThe test script automatically saves the token to the collection variable — no manual copy-paste needed."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Admin token saved:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login after promoting the user to ADMIN in the DB. Token with ADMIN role is auto-saved."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{organizer_email}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "{{organizer_email}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name",           "value": "Alice Johnson",                              "type": "text" },
                { "key": "pronoun",        "value": "she/her",                                    "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location",       "value": "Dallas, TX",                                 "type": "text" },
                { "key": "aboutMe",        "value": "Passionate event organizer and tech lover.", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes",  "value": "Technology",                                 "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes",  "value": "Photography",                                "type": "text" },
                { "key": "profilePicture", "value": "",                                           "type": "file", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update profile. A user can only update their own profile."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "📅 Events",
      "description": "Create, read, update, delete events. CUD requires ORGANIZER role.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Event (PUBLIC)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/events",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "events"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "title",         "value": "Summer Tech Meetup",                              "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description",   "value": "A networking event for Dallas tech enthusiasts.", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location",      "value": "Dallas Convention Center, Dallas TX",             "type": "text" },
                { "key": "startDateTime", "value": "2026-07-15T18:00:00",                             "type": "text" },
                { "key": "endDateTime",   "value": "2026-07-15T21:00:00",                             "type": "text" },
                { "key": "eventType",     "value": "PUBLIC",                                          "type": "text" },
                { "key": "capacity",      "value": "80",                                              "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes", "value": "Technology",                                      "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryTypes", "value": "Business & Networking",                           "type": "text" },
                { "key": "eventPicture",  "value": "",                                                "type": "file", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a public event. Requires ORGANIZER role.\nFields use camelCase — @ModelAttribute binding, not JSON.\nValid eventType: PUBLIC, GROUP"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Event (GROUP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/events",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
